  id: 7d5cd0cc60264b5b8f5ee8868c7a2f21
  DisplayName: New Steamer Service to the Eastern Ports
  EventType: 1
  Description: A shipping house {has opened|is opening} a faster route to the eastern ports, and freight rates {have fallen|are expected to fall} with it. Crates from the far east {are arriving|will arrive} in numbers no warehouse was built for, and what comes ashore by the crate {is losing|may lose} something of its rarity in the eyes of collectors. Porcelain in particular {is no longer|will no longer be} the novelty it was.
